WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.297
Random sat thresholds, computable.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.316
Add random constraints and puzzles suddenly become unsolvable.

3
00:00:06.466 --> 00:00:09.072
Gaia Carenini proved this sharp threshold first.

4
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.385
Certificates from both sides close in, so the threshold is computable.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.541
Claimed: linear variance, and a computable threshold.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.892
Checked in Lean.
